  m_Text: 'SUMBER ASSET & TEKNOLOGI:


    1. Adobe Mixamo: Karakter 3D Humanoid ''Maria'' & ''Mutant'' beserta animasi mocap asli.

    2. Unity Asset Store (Terrain & Grass Pack, Stylize Water Texture, PolyOne Stylized Rocks): Tekstur PBR tanah, jalan, air sungai, batu, dan tebing.

    3. Procedural Audio Synthesizer: Efek suara disintesis langsung tanpa file audio eksternal.

    4. Map 5v5 Land of Dawn: Arena 160m x 160m dengan 3 Lanes, Sungai Simetris, Jungle, Turret, dan Spawn Fountain.'
